That's the great thing about nethack: the choices.  Do 
you want to kill the priest now and maybe get, after some 
saccing, some nice weapon, or do you prefer to make do 
with the crap you find in the dungeon keeping the prospect 
of getting protection when you're rich?  [Notwithstanding the 
observation that protection may also be bought in the Valley.] 
It's nice to ponder such questions, then come to a decision.  

Btw, if you really want early protection, I would suggest to 
specialize in the protection dive.  This leads to protection 
plus you can come back soon, dispatch the priest and start 
saccing.  

